---
List countries and find per-country population circles

Usage: popcircles country [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list          List available countries from the selected combination's boundary source
  combinations  List configured population and boundary source combinations
  prepare       Prepare one configured country combination for local use
  fetch         Fetch one configured prepared country combination from its remote location
  smallest      Find the smallest population circle for one registered country
  sweep         Sweep requested shares over selected countries, resuming one ledger per country
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --log-level <LEVEL>  How much to report on stderr: `error`, `warn`, `info` or `debug`. It does not govern the progress meter, which answers how far a run has got rather than what happened [default: info]
      --config <PATH>      Optional configuration file layered over data/config.toml
  -h, --help               Print help
